	(text "BT1 plugs into U1's onboard PH1.25 battery header\n(P3 on the RP2350-Plus); it isn't wired on this board.\nU1 charges it at 1 A (ETA6096, R13 = 160k), about 1.25C for\n800 mAh: swap R13 for ~200k to charge at ~0.8 A (1C).\nU1 feeds VSYS from it through a Schottky diode."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
